1
00:00:00,109 --> 00:00:02,824
Tumhare FASTag mein na battery hai, na paisa.

2
00:00:03,394 --> 00:00:06,073
Phir bhi gaadi rukne se pehle hi, toll kat jaata hai.

3
00:00:06,620 --> 00:00:06,950
Kaise?

4
00:00:07,674 --> 00:00:10,430
Ye sticker ek passive RFID tag hai.

5
00:00:10,945 --> 00:00:15,604
Isme paisa nahi hota, sirf ek unique ID, gaadi ke aadhaar number jaisi.

6
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:18,469
Lekin battery ke bina ye bolta kaise hai?

7
00:00:19,162 --> 00:00:21,941
Toll lane ke upar ek reader antenna lagi hoti hai.

8
00:00:22,387 --> 00:00:26,535
Wo radio waves bhejta hai, aur wahi waves tag ko power de dete hain.

9
00:00:27,088 --> 00:00:30,019
Tag jaag jaata hai, aur apni ID wapas bhej deta hai.

10
00:00:30,357 --> 00:00:31,259
Milliseconds mein.

11
00:00:31,918 --> 00:00:33,490
Ab asli game shuru hota hai.

12
00:00:34,076 --> 00:00:36,674
Ye ID toll plaza ke bank ke paas jaati hai.

13
00:00:37,202 --> 00:00:40,302
Wo NPCI se poochta hai, ye tag kis bank ka hai?

14
00:00:40,908 --> 00:00:45,721
NPCI tumhare bank ko batata hai, aur tumhare FASTag account se toll kat jaata hai.

15
00:00:46,264 --> 00:00:49,332
Barrier khulta hai, aur phone pe SMS aa jaata hai.

16
00:00:49,938 --> 00:00:54,771
Na battery, na paisa — bas ek ID, jo seedha bank tak jaati hai.
